WEBVTT

00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:04.700
Remember this, Masaru.

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:07.950
If you're ever feeling lost,

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:12.330
think with your heart
and decide what you should do.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:17.260
And when you realize
that it's time to smile,

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:19.630
don't cry.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:28.890
I'm alive.

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:32.190
We're alive, Narumi!

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:50.040
Before dawn, when the stars paint the sky

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:55.040
I am searching for the thing I lost

00:00:55.210 --> 00:00:59.710
With a restless heart
Under the sun yet in the dark

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:04.300
I patch together little prayers
to light my path

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:09.060
I don't need anything,
as my hands are full

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:13.900
My hands are full of emptiness

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:18.650
Please, just once, nod for me

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:23.400
Just once, reach out to me like the mirror

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:28.370
I will live for that single moment,
that single second

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:33.040
All the rest can just burn away

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:37.840
What's right for me is for me alone

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:42.920
Whatever the path, I'll follow it to you

00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:47.390
This feeling grows and grows,
deep inside my heart

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:50.970
For one single reason

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:59.020
I continue to climb up on the stage

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:07.820
#5 Circus - Departure

00:02:10.450 --> 00:02:11.540
Narumi.

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:16.750
It's been 2 months since you left us.

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:26.470
Narumi.

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:32.520
I... I'm doing great.

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:40.230
I did have to stay in hospital
for quite a while with those injuries.

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:47.490
But I'm finally
going back to school today.

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:50.030
Mr. Masaru, your napkin.

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:56.500
Shirogane has quit the Straw Circus
and works as a maid at my house now.

00:02:57.370 --> 00:03:02.170
She said she wants to stay close
should anybody attack me again.

00:03:03.170 --> 00:03:05.550
And I'm grateful for that, but...

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:07.050
Here, Mr. Masaru.

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:09.090
Open wide.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:13.260
Stop that! I can feed myself.

00:03:14.430 --> 00:03:16.680
Of course. Forgive me.

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:18.480
She's overprotective.

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:20.480
I'm off!

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:23.360
A school uniform?

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:26.900
I will be going to school with you
starting today.

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:32.160
Oh, of course.
You're going to high school, right?

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:37.410
Yes, I was admitted into the school
under the Saiga name.

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:42.080
It's right next to your school,
so I'll come running if anything happens.

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:43.630
Good morning.

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:47.340
-Please.
-Thanks, but it's unnecessary.

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:49.050
Right, Shirogane?

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:51.220
-Right.
-But...

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:55.180
We want to walk together.

00:04:00.810 --> 00:04:04.610
Narumi, see how much I can smile now?

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:09.150
Shirogane is really pretty
and really nice.

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:16.080
I learned so much from you, Narumi.

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:18.830
We both did.

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:22.540
Masaru, you keep on smiling.

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:24.460
You can cry.

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:26.460
But...

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:28.460
keep on smiling.

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:32.220
May I have a word, Mr. Masaru?

00:04:32.590 --> 00:04:33.680
What is it?

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.850
This is hard to say...

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:40.020
but I heard you are bullied at school.

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:41.850
It's not really...

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:44.310
Please try not to stand out.

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:48.320
Standing out is
what irritates those people.

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:53.660
But Shirogane, I never really stood out
before either.

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:55.910
Look at my eyes.

00:04:56.410 --> 00:04:58.330
See how they're different?

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:01.830
I was bullied because of them
in circus school.

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:03.830
-You too?
-Yes.

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:08.380
But I did my best not to stand out.

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:10.130
And they soon moved on.

00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:13.180
I'm not sure that'll work.

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:17.260
Hey, isn't that Masaru?

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:19.890
After all this time.

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:22.560
Our little pet is back.

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:23.980
"MIDORI ELEMENTARY SCHOOL"

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:27.270
I will be at the high school next door.

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:28.610
Okay, bye.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:31.690
Remember, don't stand out.

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:35.360
But if they still bully you, call for me.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:37.280
I'll use Arlequin and...

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:39.910
Les Arts Martiaux...

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:41.790
I'll stand out even more!

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:54.220
I'd forgotten that
this is what they did to me.

00:05:54.840 --> 00:05:58.180
Reminds me of how I had no shoes
in that mansion.

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:02.810
This is nothing compared to that.

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:06.690
Why's he smiling?

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:09.230
He used to be a crybaby.

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:13.150
-Saiga.
-Good morning.

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:14.950
You're finally back.

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:16.610
How was your trip overseas?

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:18.410
Trip overseas?

00:06:18.570 --> 00:06:21.330
That's what the teacher told us.

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:24.290
That you were gone on a long vacation.

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:28.790
Oh yeah. Yeah, it was fun.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:30.920
Lucky you, you're so rich.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:32.760
Tell us more about it.

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:35.090
Overseas trip? Whatever.

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:37.760
He won't be smiling for long.

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:40.550
"CHUO EAST HIGH SCHOOL"

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:45.180
We will be welcoming
a foreign exchange student in our class.

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:49.400
It'll be a good chance for you all
to learn about French culture.

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:53.610
My name is Shirogane Saiga.
A pleasure to meet you.

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:56.740
-Wow, she's so pretty.
-Look at her!

00:06:56.900 --> 00:07:00.620
Whatever. French or not, who cares?

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:01.830
Snob.

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:04.950
Miss Saiga, your seat is at the back.

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:06.040
Yes.

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:09.670
Ouch!

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:12.170
Hey, stop right there.

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:13.880
What's with that suitcase?

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:16.920
Yeah, apologize!

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:23.560
My sincerest apologies.

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:24.640
Hey...

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:27.060
What? Huh?

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:29.940
Oh good, you're not hurt.

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:33.650
Please forgive me.

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:41.200
She smells nice.

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:43.160
A true French girl.

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:46.450
I'm going to talk to her.

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:49.000
How do you say "hi" in French...?

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:52.460
I... um... merci!

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:58.970
"LET'S CHANGE YOUR DIAPER."
"OKAY, I'LL PAY YOU."

00:08:01.090 --> 00:08:04.310
Kajiyama's at it again, Orie.

00:08:05.470 --> 00:08:07.560
I know, I hate it.

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:11.060
But it's Saiga's fault too.
He never stands up for himself.

00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:14.770
I might be class president,
but I'm not helping.

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:18.530
You're good at drawing.

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:24.580
Damn it.

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:27.120
Stand up. Bow.

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:29.790
All, sit.

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:44.930
I knew it. Mr. Masaru's being bullied.

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:49.520
He held his strong hands
up to the fire...

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:54.190
and told us about his adventurous
hunting trip.

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:02.200
Oh, poor Mr. Masaru!

00:09:02.360 --> 00:09:03.570
I wish I could...

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:09.620
No, I'd make him stand out.

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:16.130
What is it?

00:09:16.420 --> 00:09:20.210
You're back after all this time,
and didn't even greet us properly.

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:22.380
You're our servant, remember?

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:24.220
Oh yeah, sorry...

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:27.720
Who do you think you are?
You rich crybaby!

00:09:27.970 --> 00:09:29.010
Mr. Masaru!

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:31.270
Stop it, Kajiyama.

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:34.100
He didn't do anything to you.

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:35.270
What?

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:37.520
She's nice.

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:41.650
What now, Orie? I bet you like Masaru.

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:43.110
No, I don't!

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:46.530
Then stay out of this
or we'll bully you too.

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:51.790
Don't, Kajiyama. And I'm fine, Miss Ueda.

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:53.660
Don't mind me.

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:57.330
Come on, that's exactly why
they keep picking on you.

00:09:59.170 --> 00:10:00.250
That's okay.

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:03.470
Why are you smiling? You little brat!

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:04.430
Mr. Masaru!

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:21.730
He's not like before.

00:10:22.690 --> 00:10:23.740
Saiga...

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:28.160
Sorry. I didn't want to scare everyone.

00:10:28.490 --> 00:10:30.450
So I hid it with a bandana.

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:34.660
But you'll all find out anyway

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:38.130
since the next class is PE.

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:43.840
This isn't something
you tell everyone, but...

00:10:48.430 --> 00:10:53.020
I wasn't away on a vacation.

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:57.350
I went through some really scary things.

00:10:58.230 --> 00:11:04.190
I found out there are people who don't
think twice about killing.

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:08.740
These are the scars I got then.

00:11:09.740 --> 00:11:15.330
So compared to that, no amount
of bullying could get to me now.

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:18.370
But...

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:21.880
that's not what I wanted to say.

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:26.590
Kajiyama, you asked me why I was smiling.

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:31.930
It's because there was someone
who saved me.

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:36.350
Whatever happened, he never gave in.

00:11:37.770 --> 00:11:39.900
Whatever the danger, he smiled.

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:45.780
I want to be like him.

00:11:48.030 --> 00:11:51.950
So I have to smile.
I have to keep smiling.

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:57.450
Explain yourself!

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:01.380
She skipped class on her first day here.

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:04.670
She really does stand out, huh.

00:12:05.380 --> 00:12:06.880
"RECYCLING SERVICES"

00:12:07.010 --> 00:12:11.010
Mr. Nakamachi, I've put up with you
long enough.

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:14.560
You haven't paid your rent
for a whole year.

00:12:15.350 --> 00:12:19.230
-I'm really sorry.
-Sorry.

00:12:19.520 --> 00:12:22.520
I just need a bit more time...

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:28.570
Just give up on that circus nonsense.

00:12:31.320 --> 00:12:33.200
It's out of date.

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:37.410
I'm telling you.

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:41.370
Shut up!

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:43.420
Out of date, my ass!

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:46.630
We've put our lives on our line
to keep it going!

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:49.300
-Boss!
-Calm down!

00:12:56.850 --> 00:12:58.770
Hey, Saiga?

00:12:58.930 --> 00:12:59.770
Yeah?

00:13:00.680 --> 00:13:03.310
You've changed.

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:05.230
-Have I?
-Yeah.

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:07.270
Like with Kajiyama just now.

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:09.190
What happened?

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:14.780
You said someone saved you.
What were they like?

00:13:16.740 --> 00:13:20.160
There were two. One was a French girl.

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:22.960
She's at the high school next door.

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:28.250
She's always really serious
so I'm sure she's studying hard.

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:31.800
Do not remember the empty cheers.

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:35.840
What else could have remained forever
in one's ears?

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:39.720
Sleep in the quiet blue of the mirror.

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:44.390
Wow, is she really not Japanese?
What a fine voice!

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:45.940
"HOME ECONOMICS"

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:55.360
Miss Shirogane, you don't have to
do all that.

00:13:58.700 --> 00:13:59.580
It's ready.

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:02.290
Looks so delicious!

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:04.960
-Give me a bite!
-No, me!

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:11.000
She was in the circus?

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:13.590
She must be good at sports then.

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:14.510
Yep.

00:14:16.050 --> 00:14:18.930
Miss Kozuka will show us an example.

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:20.390
Here I go.

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:33.990
Look at her. Trying to stand out
just because she's on the gym team.

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:36.320
Stand out? That must not be.

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:40.160
I was bullied because of my eyes
when I was in circus school.

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:42.660
Huh? You were in the circus?

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:46.870
Miss! Let's have Miss Shirogane
show us, too.

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:49.290
I... I'd rather not stand out.

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:53.670
Good idea. Give it a shot.
It doesn't have to be difficult.

00:14:54.590 --> 00:14:57.010
But what should I do?

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:01.680
Something like the other girl did?

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:13.280
That little snob. What can she do, huh?

00:15:36.840 --> 00:15:37.630
What the...?

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:40.840
She's just being a show-off.
You're a lot better.

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:50.850
That's not gymnastics.

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:16.420
You beat me...!

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:25.680
That Shirogane person sounds like
she's perfect.

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:27.720
Perfect?

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:31.230
No, Miss Ueda. She isn't.

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:34.560
Shirogane isn't perfect at all.

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:41.780
No matter how much she's praised,
how much people love her,

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:44.780
she never laughs.

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:50.460
She just tilts her head and
shows a sad little smile.

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:52.460
"NIHON IKAGAKU HOSPITAL"

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:55.590
Shirogane told me how she felt,

00:16:56.300 --> 00:17:00.300
when I was hospitalized
after what happened at the mansion.

00:17:01.840 --> 00:17:03.010
Mr. Masaru.

00:17:04.220 --> 00:17:08.060
I couldn't smile for Kato that time,

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:12.020
despite him suffering a ZONAPHA attack.

00:17:13.310 --> 00:17:17.230
He needed somebody to smile
for it to calm down.

00:17:21.360 --> 00:17:25.160
So I can't anymore...

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:32.250
Narumi needed somebody to smile then,

00:17:32.830 --> 00:17:35.080
but Shirogane couldn't smile for him.

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:41.050
So as long as Shirogane
remembers Narumi...

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:43.430
she won't be able to smile.

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:49.600
But there's no way we could forget him.

00:17:51.220 --> 00:17:54.900
Tell me, Narumi.

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:59.610
What can I do to make Shirogane smile?

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:01.690
Hey, Saiga.

00:18:02.110 --> 00:18:06.450
So what circus is Miss Shirogane
going to join next?

00:18:07.570 --> 00:18:08.410
Circus?

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:13.040
Yeah, she was in one, right?
She should join another.

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:17.040
I want to go see her perform in a circus.

00:18:17.670 --> 00:18:20.000
That's it, a circus.

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:31.010
Damn it, why do I have to do all this?

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:33.560
It's because you made
the landlord mad.

00:18:34.770 --> 00:18:36.190
It's the least we can do.

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:38.650
But what do we do now?

00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:43.110
You think the landlord was right
about circuses being outdated?

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:47.410
Probably. Kids are only into
TV shows and games these days.

00:18:47.780 --> 00:18:52.290
Is God telling us to quit the circus?

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:55.080
Where are you taking me?

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:56.960
The circus!

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:59.420
Circus? What do you mean...

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:01.630
Around here somewhere...

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:03.090
There it is!

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:04.590
"NAKAMACHI CIRCUS"

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:09.470
See? I haven't seen it yet,
but there's a circus in this town, too.

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:12.560
You like the circus, right?

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:18.060
Wait. I don't care about what I want.

00:19:18.230 --> 00:19:21.730
But I do! You do everything for me.

00:19:22.150 --> 00:19:25.610
You should have fun, too.

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:28.410
So join the circus.

00:19:28.570 --> 00:19:29.740
Hold on there.

00:19:31.030 --> 00:19:36.040
I just overheard you two.
You want to join the circus, young girl?

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:38.710
Are you from the circus?

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:41.250
Yeah, I'm Shinobu Nakamachi, the boss.

00:19:41.540 --> 00:19:43.750
Woah, she's hot!

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:46.590
Hello. My name is Masaru.

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:51.760
Please let Shirogane join your circus.

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:54.430
But I haven't said I would...

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:57.140
Come on, Shirogane.

00:19:57.310 --> 00:19:59.520
Hey, naughty little boy.

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:03.230
You can't pester someone
into joining a circus.

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:06.150
You're in the circus?

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:07.740
What do you do?

00:20:08.900 --> 00:20:11.660
-If you insist!
-Just a little bit then.

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:20.580
Wow!

00:20:21.670 --> 00:20:24.090
Shirogane, show them something too.

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:26.340
Yes, Mr. Masaru.

00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:44.060
Incredible.

00:20:44.230 --> 00:20:46.570
So you'll really join us?

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:51.700
Mr. Masaru. My mission is to protect you.

00:20:52.450 --> 00:20:57.120
But if your wish is for me
to do what I like...

00:20:58.120 --> 00:21:01.670
then I will join these people.

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:03.750
In the circus.

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:09.510
I can tell you have charisma
as a performer.

00:21:09.800 --> 00:21:12.220
The future is beginning to look bright.

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:15.220
Nakamachi Circus is going up from here!

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:18.140
-Right on!
-All right!

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:22.100
Let me introduce you.
These two are Nori and Hiro.

00:21:22.350 --> 00:21:23.850
And there's one more.

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:27.480
Our animal handler, Sister Liselotte.

00:21:28.020 --> 00:21:29.280
Nice to meet you.

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:32.700
The pleasure is all mine.

00:21:34.570 --> 00:21:38.740
Narumi, I can smile. All the time.

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:42.080
Because you taught me how.

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:45.540
Shirogane will be able to too, someday.

00:21:46.670 --> 00:21:50.710
So don't worry about us, Narumi.

00:22:14.490 --> 00:22:16.870
Fly up high, Marionette

00:22:17.030 --> 00:22:19.200
Turn to ash, gracefully

00:22:19.370 --> 00:22:23.660
My only purpose in life was to fight

00:22:23.870 --> 00:22:28.420
Why am I so angry
even I dump my humanity

00:22:28.590 --> 00:22:34.840
Without you, I can't smile anymore

00:22:35.840 --> 00:22:40.010
I assume that I am to be blamed

00:22:40.180 --> 00:22:44.310
Like a puppet that can't smile naturally

00:22:44.730 --> 00:22:49.690
I feel like someone is pulling my strings

00:22:49.860 --> 00:22:53.400
What am I even living for?

00:22:53.570 --> 00:22:57.740
I was hurt, and thought
that nobody would understand

00:22:57.910 --> 00:23:02.870
But you came along,
and took me in your arms

00:23:03.040 --> 00:23:09.000
I felt my tangled arms and legs

00:23:09.500 --> 00:23:11.420
become free

00:23:11.710 --> 00:23:14.170
Fly up high, Marionette

00:23:14.340 --> 00:23:16.300
I think now I can reach you

00:23:16.470 --> 00:23:20.800
Before I met you, I was empty

00:23:20.970 --> 00:23:25.680
Now I have something
I'd give my all to protect

00:23:25.850 --> 00:23:32.070
You taught me how to feel,
the feeling of sorrow too
